{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"层上同调"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"(Abel) 层上同调"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>Before arriving at the full picture of higher topos theory … people had a pretty good guess about some aspects of this story, and this aspect they called sheaf cohomology. It turns out that sheaf cohomology is precisely the <em>abelian</em> part of general cohomology.</p>\n<p>Here is what “abelian part of general cohomology” means:\nFor many sheaves that appear in practice, the topological space $X(U)$ assigned to any test space $U$ is not just a topological space, but happens to have the structure of an <strong>abelian group</strong>, too. In this case a cascade of simplifications kicks in: first of all, such topological spaces, by a special case of something called the <strong>homotopy hypothesis</strong> (which is now really a precise theorem) can be identified with simplicial abelian groups. Second, by another theorem called the <strong>Dold–Kan correspondence</strong>, simplicial abelian groups are equivalently encoded more simply in the collection of data given by (non-positively graded) <strong>chain complexes in abelian groups</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>拓扑空间 $X$ 上 Abel 群层的上同调 $H^i(X,-)$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"整体截面","text":"整体截面"}},{"Plain":" $\\Gamma$ 的右"},{"Local":{"url":"导出函子","text":"导出函子"}},{"Plain":", 也即 $X\\to *$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"导出前推","text":"导出前推"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>空间 $X$ 上的层上同调可视为 $X$ 上的 "},{"Local":{"url":"∞-层∞-意象","text":"∞-层 ∞-意象"}},{"Plain":"中的映射同伦类:\n$$\r\nH^n(X,F)\\simeq \\pi_0\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\operatorname{Sh}(X,\\infty \\mathsf {Grpd})}(X,B^nF).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>具体地, 设有"},{"Local":{"url":"内射消解","text":"内射消解"}},{"Plain":" $F\\to I^\\bullet$, 定义 $H^n(X,F) := H^n(\\Gamma(X,I^\\bullet))$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Čech上同调","text":"Čech 上同调"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"奇异上同调","text":"奇异上同调"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}